From 1dc288fd4a5b1dc87360ba8ecc692b75f40517ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeBeOS <debeos@debene.dev>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] vendor/golang.org/x/sys: add the haiku port

Grafted from the korli/go fork's cmd/vendor copy (x/sys v0.39.0 plus the
haiku/amd64 and DeBeOS haiku/arm64 tables) onto the vendored v0.47.0.
Upstream x/sys has no haiku GOOS, so without this every importer of
golang.org/x/sys/unix fails to compile.
---
